{title: 298 - I Lay My Sins on Jesus}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Gospel}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[F]I lay my [Am/C]sins [C7]on Jesus,
[Gm]The [C7/G]spotless [Am]Lamb [Bb]of [C]God;
[F]He bears them [Bb]all, [Gm]and [C7]frees us
[Am]From the accursed load,
[Gm]From the accursed [C7]load.

Verse 2:
[F]I bring my [Am/C]guilt [C7]to Jesus,
[Gm]To [C7/G]wash my [Am]crimson [C]stains
[F]White in His [Bb]blood [Gm]most [C7]precious,
[Am]Till not a stain remains,
[Gm]Till not a [C7]stain remains.

Verse 3:
[F]I lay my [Am/C]wants [C7]on Jesus,
[Gm]All [C7/G]fullness [Am]dwells [Bb]in [C]Him;
[F]He healeth [Bb]my [Gm]diseases,
[Am]He doth my soul redeem,
[Gm]He doth my [C7]soul redeem.

Verse 4:
[F]I long to [Am/C]be [C7]like Jesus,
[Gm]Meek [C7/G]loving, [Am]lowly, [C]mild;
[F]I long to [Bb]be [Gm]like [C7]Jesus,
[Am]The Father's holy child,
[Gm]The Father's [C7]holy [F]child.

Verse 5:
[F]I long to [Am/C]be [C7]with Jesus
[Gm]Amid [C7/G]the [Am]heav'nly [C]throng,
[F]To sing with [Bb]them [Gm]His [C7]praises,
[Am]And learn the angels'song,
[Gm]And learn the [C7]angels'song.
